---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me - Sara El Aam">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-black flex flex-col justify-center px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 pt-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-10 gap-2 items-start pt-20 pb-32">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-2">
        <h1 class="text-[12vw] lg:text-[10rem] font-clash font-light leading-none tracking-tighter text-primary uppercase select-none whitespace-nowrap animate-on-scroll">
          ABOUT ME
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-full lg:col-start-5">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-white text-lg md:text-xl font-clash font-light leading-relaxed tracking-tight">
          <p class="animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
           I’m Sara Elaam, a graphic designer currently completing a Master’s degree at <span class="font-semibold">BAU Centro Universitario de Artes y Diseño, located in Barcelona, Spain</span>. I hold a Bachelor’s degree in Graphic Design from <span class="font-semibold"> École Supérieure des Arts Visuels (ESAV), based in Marrakech, Morocco.</span>
          </p>
          <p class="animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
            where I developed a strong foundation in visual identity, editorial design, and concept-driven projects. My practice is rooted in research and storytelling, exploring how design can carry meaning, culture, and intention. I’m curious, detail-oriented, and drawn to projects that question, connect, and communicate.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
